WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.840
AIs beat humans at Go, generate text and even art!

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.720
Are AIs of today already smarter than you?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.720
The short answer is…
no.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.520
While you are a general intelligence, capable of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.960
making analogies and quickly&nbsp;
adapting to new situations,

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.520
current AI’s are highly specialized, but&nbsp;
have trouble with mundane situations.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.560
Even worse, they solve problems in unrobust ways:

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.080
Imagine an AI with the goal of telling the&nbsp;
exact time of the mailman’s daily arrival.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.680
The AI learns his behavior by&nbsp;
observing him for two weeks.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:36.400
When finally ready to make predictions, it&nbsp;
notifies you that the mailman has arrived!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.240
But you see no mailman, only&nbsp;
Ms. Coffee Bean playing outside.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.560
Why did the AI make this mistake?

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.680
Because in the two weeks of&nbsp;
training, the appearance of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.960
the mailman was correlated with&nbsp;
Ms. Coffee Bean’s appearance!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:55.440
Such mistakes are characteristic for today’s AIs&nbsp;
that are overly complicated correlation detectors.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.480
Think about this the next&nbsp;
time you see an AI headline.

